WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.875
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.145 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.305 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:42.105 --> 01:42.945
STARS SHINE UPON AUSPICIOUS CLOUDS

5
01:43.025 --> 01:46.825
Your Zhuyu Estate had the finest scenery in the capital.

6
01:46.905 --> 01:48.865
But you tore it down to help the needy.

7
01:49.385 --> 01:52.665
My garden is nothing special, yet you're praising it to the skies.

8
01:54.865 --> 01:56.425
How strange.

9
01:57.185 --> 01:58.705
I begged you to stay at yesterday's banquet,

10
01:58.785 --> 02:00.465
but you wouldn't hear of it.

11
02:00.545 --> 02:02.385
Now you want a tour of the garden?

12
02:02.945 --> 02:07.185
Can this compare to the natural beauty of your Mount Yaowang?

13
02:08.304 --> 02:11.585
Who wants to drink with a bunch of obnoxious men?

14
02:11.665 --> 02:13.865
They're fat, bloated, and hard to look at.

15
02:13.945 --> 02:14.785
So vulgar.

16
02:16.785 --> 02:18.465
Only the most favored officials get invited

17
02:18.545 --> 02:20.145
to the Crown Prince's Residence.

18
02:22.505 --> 02:25.465
And you, my dear sister, have won the Crown Prince's favor.

19
02:27.305 --> 02:29.585
Half the world is dying of envy. And you're still not content?

20
02:31.465 --> 02:33.105
Enough about that.

21
02:33.945 --> 02:37.265
I heard the Crown Prince brought rare stones from the south for his garden.

22
02:38.465 --> 02:40.545
Every turn reveals something beautiful.

23
02:41.345 --> 02:43.545
Your Highness, show me around some more.

24
02:44.065 --> 02:44.985
I want to see it all.

25
02:47.985 --> 02:51.025
All right, all right. You always get your way.

26
02:53.145 --> 02:54.225
Watch your step, Rao.

27
02:57.665 --> 02:58.705
Look.

28
03:32.465 --> 03:33.585
NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED DURING FILMING

29
03:33.665 --> 03:34.825
FILMED UNDER PROFESSIONAL SUPERVISION WITHOUT HARM

30
03:42.545 --> 03:44.425
-The Crown Prince hit the target! -Bravo!

31
03:44.505 --> 03:46.385
-Your Highness is mighty! -Indeed!

32
03:46.465 --> 03:48.105
-Your Highness is mighty! -Excellent shot.

33
03:48.185 --> 03:49.985
The Crown Prince is in fine form today.

34
03:50.065 --> 03:51.745
We've barely entered the woods, and he's already made a kill.

35
03:52.345 --> 03:54.385
Everyone knows you're a master archer, Lord Lu.

36
03:55.265 --> 03:57.105
I'm showing off before an expert.

37
03:57.185 --> 03:58.425
How embarrassing.

38
03:58.505 --> 04:00.865
Your Highness is so busy with state affairs, you rarely get to hunt.

39
04:01.385 --> 04:02.785
Otherwise, the rest of us would never get a chance to shine.

40
04:03.385 --> 04:05.225
Lord Lu, you've always been so aloof.

41
04:05.745 --> 04:07.545
Whenever we brothers invite you to a banquet,

42
04:07.625 --> 04:09.425
you make every excuse not to come.

43
04:10.025 --> 04:12.385
So you do know how to flatter my imperial brother.

44
04:13.745 --> 04:16.305
I meant every word. How is that flattery?

45
04:17.465 --> 04:20.665
Your Highness, I hear a great white tiger roams these woods.

46
04:21.465 --> 04:24.065
If you capture it alive and present it to His Majesty,

47
04:24.145 --> 04:25.105
he'll be delighted.

48
04:25.185 --> 04:26.385
Really? A great white tiger?

49
04:27.745 --> 04:31.025
Hunters say it's often spotted roaming the ridge ahead.

50
04:32.225 --> 04:33.065
I'll lead the way, Your Highness.

51
04:33.825 --> 04:35.025
Quick! Lead us there!

52
04:36.985 --> 04:38.865
I thought the Lu family was above all this.

53
04:38.945 --> 04:41.425
But the moment my brother became Crown Prince,

54
04:41.505 --> 04:43.265
they couldn't wait to cozy up to him.

55
04:43.865 --> 04:44.745
Come on.

56
04:45.345 --> 04:48.065
Let's capture that white tiger first. That'll be a great achievement.

57
04:48.665 --> 04:50.225
Brothers, wait for me!

58
04:55.585 --> 04:57.545
SPRING'S EMBRACE

59
04:57.625 --> 04:58.585
Anything unusual?

60
04:58.665 --> 05:00.025
-Everything's normal. -Good.

61
05:05.385 --> 05:07.225
The Crown Prince thinks very highly of you, Shu.

62
05:08.385 --> 05:10.305
When he acts inappropriately,

63
05:10.825 --> 05:13.785
you should try to set him straight.

64
05:13.865 --> 05:14.865
Set him straight?

65
05:16.625 --> 05:18.225
He holds the royal power.

66
05:18.305 --> 05:20.145
Who am I to tell him no?

67
05:20.745 --> 05:24.145
Sometimes, Rao, your innocence is almost adorable.

68
05:30.945 --> 05:32.785
SPRING'S EMBRACE

69
05:42.025 --> 05:43.985
What's inside that courtyard?

70
05:44.745 --> 05:47.545
Just a storeroom. Nothing worth seeing.

71
05:48.225 --> 05:50.145
Let's go feed the golden carp in the eastern lake.

72
05:51.745 --> 05:53.985
You must be hiding something precious in there.

73
05:54.505 --> 05:57.425
If Your Highness won't let me see it, that only makes me more curious.

74
06:19.865 --> 06:22.425
It seems the Lady of Wu'an

75
06:24.305 --> 06:25.465
didn't come for a tour today.

76
06:26.745 --> 06:29.105
My younger sister, Hongxian, was abducted for no reason.

77
06:29.625 --> 06:31.345
Someone saw she's in the Crown Prince's Residence.

78
06:32.425 --> 06:34.265
Hongxian is just a naive country girl.

79
06:34.345 --> 06:37.065
Please, Your Highness, show her mercy and let her go home.

80
06:38.185 --> 06:40.825
I'll owe you a favor, and I'll repay it someday.

81
06:46.785 --> 06:48.985
Who gave you permission to mistreat our guest?

82
06:49.065 --> 06:50.105
Leave us.

83
06:55.945 --> 06:58.945
There's someone I'd like you to meet, dear sister.

84
07:10.625 --> 07:11.785
Greetings, Your Ladyship.

85
07:23.945 --> 07:26.465
Your Ladyship, do you remember this man?

86
07:27.665 --> 07:29.825
He's Jin Chang, the head stewardess of my Wei family.

87
07:31.225 --> 07:32.785
He's also the man who got you out of prison.

88
07:37.105 --> 07:40.145
Leave us. I'd like a word alone with Her Ladyship.

89
07:52.825 --> 07:56.065
Forced to kill someone. Thrown into prison.

90
08:04.505 --> 08:07.705
Tortured so brutally that death seemed kinder.

91
08:07.785 --> 08:09.105
Just to stay alive,

92
08:09.185 --> 08:12.425
you had to grovel before the vilest guards and prisoners.

93
08:13.705 --> 08:15.305
-How humiliating that must have been. -Have some water.

94
08:15.385 --> 08:16.385
Drink it!

95
08:17.145 --> 08:18.625
In a place like that,

96
08:18.705 --> 08:21.745
-Drink! -a woman on death row…

97
08:21.825 --> 08:23.585
-Just trying to survive… -Good!

98
08:23.665 --> 08:26.265
-How much humiliation must she endure? -Drink!

99
08:27.145 --> 08:28.865
I can only imagine.

100
08:30.585 --> 08:31.625
But

101
08:33.264 --> 08:34.705
would Lord Lu understand?

102
08:35.505 --> 08:38.065
What about those refugees who worship you?

103
08:38.144 --> 08:40.904
Could they accept that the noble, untouchable Lady of Wu'an

104
08:40.985 --> 08:43.784
was once a lowly death-row inmate?

105
08:46.145 --> 08:47.105
Rao,

106
08:48.025 --> 08:49.185
rumors can destroy a person.

107
08:49.785 --> 08:52.065
-Are you threatening me? -I'm giving you a friendly warning.

108
08:55.545 --> 08:56.745
Rao,

109
08:57.265 --> 08:59.785
every step you've taken has been dangerous.

110
08:59.865 --> 09:01.745
You fought so hard to get where you are.

111
09:02.345 --> 09:05.465
Now you have a title and your own lands, not to mention everyone's respect.

112
09:07.225 --> 09:09.145
Why can't you appreciate what you have?

113
09:09.745 --> 09:11.465
Why did you have to stick your nose in?

114
09:19.305 --> 09:20.505
Hongxian is my adoptive mother's daughter.

115
09:21.945 --> 09:24.585
Rao! That's my sister's voice!

116
09:24.665 --> 09:26.145
I can stay out of everything else.

117
09:27.065 --> 09:29.465
Just give her back to me, please.

118
09:34.465 --> 09:35.505
Rao!

119
09:35.585 --> 09:40.145
Save me! Don't leave me! Rao! Rao!

120
09:41.345 --> 09:42.345
Are you begging me?

121
09:47.705 --> 09:48.705
Yes.

122
09:52.505 --> 09:53.505
I'm begging you.

123
09:53.585 --> 09:55.985
Wei Rao, you were born into the Wei family.

124
09:56.065 --> 09:57.745
Noble blood runs through your veins.

125
09:57.825 --> 09:59.585
How could you have a sister from the slums?

126
10:00.425 --> 10:01.785
Someone so lowly…

127
10:01.865 --> 10:03.185
-has nothing to do with you! -But…

128
10:03.265 --> 10:05.105
Don't you understand?

129
10:05.665 --> 10:07.505
Who would claim kinship with a servant's child?

130
10:08.345 --> 10:10.505
If you want to be true nobility,

131
10:10.585 --> 10:14.585
you must cut ties with those filthy, lowborn people.

132
10:21.065 --> 10:22.345
Have you given up yet?

133
10:22.945 --> 10:26.025
Be good and do as you're told. Let's go.

134
10:30.305 --> 10:31.385
Stop!

135
10:32.465 --> 10:33.625
Rao!

136
10:35.185 --> 10:38.065
Rao! Rao!

137
10:39.145 --> 10:40.745
Come here, you!

138
10:45.705 --> 10:47.465
SPRING'S EMBRACE

139
10:51.825 --> 10:53.505
-Hongxian! -Wei Rao,

140
10:53.585 --> 10:54.905
this is the Crown Prince's Residence!

141
10:54.985 --> 10:56.505
You can't just barge in!

142
11:04.745 --> 11:07.305
Rao, go home.

143
11:08.305 --> 11:10.705
Bury your past forever.

144
11:10.785 --> 11:15.105
Stay away from those lowborn people. You're only lowering yourself.

145
11:24.585 --> 11:25.505
Come here.

146
11:30.825 --> 11:34.865
‎SPRING'S EMBRACE

147
12:03.705 --> 12:05.785
Learn from the Lady of Wu'an.

148
12:06.345 --> 12:07.825
She knows when to give in.

149
12:20.185 --> 12:21.985
I'm trying to save Wei Rao.

150
12:23.065 --> 12:24.345
And I'm trying to save you, too.

151
12:25.465 --> 12:26.785
If you keep being stubborn,

152
12:27.385 --> 12:29.265
you'll end up joining the dead.

153
12:35.265 --> 12:37.065
Clean her up.

154
12:37.145 --> 12:38.585
Then send her to serve His Highness.

155
12:39.585 --> 12:40.505
Yes, Your Highness.

156
12:57.545 --> 12:58.745
Get up!

157
13:05.665 --> 13:07.745
My Lord, this courtyard's been abandoned for years.

158
13:07.825 --> 13:09.705
No one's lived here. Why would Her Ladyship come here?

159
13:12.585 --> 13:13.425
Wait outside.

160
13:14.905 --> 13:15.745
Yes, My Lord.

161
13:40.945 --> 13:42.105
Wei Rao.

162
13:42.905 --> 13:46.545
She could've done me a simple favor and given Hongxian back.

163
13:48.945 --> 13:50.185
But she didn't.

164
13:51.665 --> 13:53.865
Even with my title as Lady of Wu'an,

165
13:55.185 --> 13:57.305
those royal nobles still see me

166
13:58.905 --> 14:00.705
as beneath them.

167
14:10.345 --> 14:11.745
They look down on me.

168
14:13.025 --> 14:14.785
Deep down, they despise me.

169
14:18.865 --> 14:20.185
-Wei Rao. -Tell me…

170
14:25.345 --> 14:27.865
Why did fate bring me

171
14:30.385 --> 14:31.785
to a place like this?

172
14:33.225 --> 14:35.065
The rich feast on the finest grains,

173
14:35.945 --> 14:37.865
while the poor survive on scraps and husks.

174
14:38.665 --> 14:40.825
My stomach isn't like theirs.

175
14:42.425 --> 14:44.745
I can't stomach their rich food and wine.

176
14:46.025 --> 14:48.145
My eyes aren't like theirs, either.

177
14:48.905 --> 14:50.865
When I see dancers entertaining the nobles,

178
14:52.545 --> 14:55.585
all I can think about is how little their families sold them for,

179
14:56.185 --> 14:58.465
and whether their children are going hungry.

180
15:02.465 --> 15:03.625
And my hands…

181
15:07.185 --> 15:08.025
Look.

182
15:15.105 --> 15:16.185
Feel them.

183
15:16.265 --> 15:18.945
My hands aren't like theirs, either. They're different.

184
15:19.865 --> 15:21.225
No matter how many expensive treatments I use,

185
15:21.825 --> 15:23.305
they're still rough.

186
15:25.705 --> 15:26.945
Why?

187
15:29.345 --> 15:31.225
Why did fate make me this way?

188
15:33.185 --> 15:35.705
I'm neither a commoner nor a noble.

189
15:36.265 --> 15:38.905
When I sit among them, I never fit in!

190
15:38.985 --> 15:41.225
They call me crazy! They call me a fool!

191
15:41.745 --> 15:44.385
But I could've lived just as comfortably and carefree as they do.

192
15:44.465 --> 15:47.265
Why can't I? Why?

193
15:48.825 --> 15:52.385
Why can't I? Why can't I?!

194
16:02.105 --> 16:03.145
You're different.

195
16:05.705 --> 16:07.025
Then be different.

196
16:11.905 --> 16:14.345
Now, come with me.

197
17:36.065 --> 17:37.145
Do you see?

198
17:40.385 --> 17:41.505
That was me.

199
17:43.945 --> 17:45.145
I was her.

200
17:46.185 --> 17:47.345
All of this…

201
17:48.705 --> 17:49.585
I already know.

202
17:49.665 --> 17:51.745
But you've never seen it with your own eyes.

203
17:53.505 --> 17:55.345
If I were still dumping chamber pots,

204
17:55.425 --> 17:57.545
and you rode past on horseback,

205
17:59.225 --> 18:01.345
would you even spare me a glance?

206
18:04.145 --> 18:05.305
You wouldn't.

207
18:06.945 --> 18:08.225
Neither would Qi Zhongkai.

208
18:11.145 --> 18:13.145
Even the stray dogs

209
18:14.225 --> 18:15.865
would run away from me.

210
18:20.705 --> 18:22.505
Who could ever love that version of me?

211
18:23.985 --> 18:25.985
What if I were just an ordinary,

212
18:26.065 --> 18:28.705
ugly, boring man?

213
18:29.665 --> 18:31.265
Not the heir to a duke's estate.

214
18:32.985 --> 18:34.145
Not the man you see before you.

215
18:35.305 --> 18:36.785
Would you still marry me?

216
18:45.505 --> 18:47.185
When we first met,

217
18:48.625 --> 18:50.345
I was the heir to the Duke of Ying.

218
18:50.985 --> 18:52.785
And you were the substitute bride.

219
18:53.465 --> 18:55.945
I can't go back and give you an answer.

220
18:56.865 --> 18:58.385
The woman I see

221
18:59.905 --> 19:03.585
is the one standing here, right in front of me.

222
19:05.985 --> 19:07.625
Your past may have been painful.

223
19:07.705 --> 19:10.025
Then let it be painful.So what?

224
19:11.945 --> 19:13.585
I should be thanking her.

225
19:17.025 --> 19:17.865
For what?

226
19:18.785 --> 19:21.065
For her strength. For never giving up.

227
19:21.585 --> 19:23.505
For her ambition. For never once bowing her head.

228
19:25.465 --> 19:27.945
Step by step,

229
19:30.425 --> 19:32.225
she made her way to me.

230
19:34.505 --> 19:36.065
That girl named A-Chou…

231
19:38.785 --> 19:40.385
How remarkable she must have been.

232
20:02.585 --> 20:03.945
But Lu Zhuo…

233
20:05.425 --> 20:06.825
I don't know what to do anymore.

234
20:07.585 --> 20:09.945
They're pressuring me. They won't stop.

235
20:10.985 --> 20:11.865
Who?

236
20:12.985 --> 20:14.185
Who's threatening you?

237
20:15.265 --> 20:17.145
My shameful past…

238
20:18.025 --> 20:20.305
I don't want anyone to know.

239
20:20.385 --> 20:22.425
I can't bear those judgmental looks again.

240
20:22.505 --> 20:23.465
But the Crown Prince…

241
20:24.745 --> 20:27.105
He's gotten hold of Jin Chang, the Wei family's steward.

242
20:27.985 --> 20:29.945
He's the one who got me out of prison.

243
20:31.025 --> 20:33.265
He knows every humiliating, awful thing I went through.

244
20:34.945 --> 20:36.385
I can't take it anymore.

245
20:37.625 --> 20:38.785
Please help me.

246
20:39.585 --> 20:41.145
Help me get rid of this threat, please.

247
20:42.425 --> 20:43.265
Where is he?

248
20:46.505 --> 20:47.985
The Crown Prince has a private prison

249
20:48.905 --> 20:50.425
on the east side of the city.

250
20:51.905 --> 20:53.265
Jin Chang is being held there.

251
20:54.145 --> 20:55.505
If he gets out and starts talking…

252
20:55.585 --> 20:56.665
-Then I'll… -He won't.

253
20:58.945 --> 21:00.425
You'll never see him again.

254
21:02.865 --> 21:03.985
I promise.

255
21:06.785 --> 21:07.625
Really?

256
21:22.585 --> 21:23.505
Here.

257
21:23.585 --> 21:24.945
They call it the Crown Prince's private prison,

258
21:25.025 --> 21:26.385
but it's really just a separate estate.

259
21:26.905 --> 21:29.825
Our scouts say he keeps thieves and runaway servants there,

260
21:29.905 --> 21:31.065
caught during his patrols.

261
21:31.945 --> 21:33.065
That's all.

262
21:34.425 --> 21:36.785
The Crown Prince is known for his kindness and humility.

263
21:37.385 --> 21:40.145
He has an excellent reputation at court. But he's still royalty.

264
21:40.225 --> 21:41.945
Who knows what he's really like in private?

265
21:42.025 --> 21:45.345
Are those prisoners truly criminals or innocent people?

266
21:45.425 --> 21:47.345
Who would dare question him?

267
21:48.505 --> 21:51.185
The man you're looking for… Is he really inside that estate?

268
21:55.905 --> 22:00.985
NOBLE AND BRIGHT

269
22:01.705 --> 22:02.785
Maybe.

270
22:03.305 --> 22:05.225
You never make a move unless you're sure.

271
22:05.825 --> 22:07.785
Why are you being so evasive?

272
22:07.865 --> 22:08.705
Is something wrong?

273
22:09.585 --> 22:10.825
Stop asking so many questions.

274
22:12.025 --> 22:13.145
You'll find out soon enough.

275
22:14.985 --> 22:17.705
Don't you think Wei Rao has changed a lot?

276
22:20.905 --> 22:21.905
I trust her.

277
22:23.945 --> 22:26.305
-Why are we here? -No idea.

278
22:26.385 --> 22:28.905
-Do you know what is it about? -Let's hear it.

279
22:30.065 --> 22:32.025
So many people train here,

280
22:32.945 --> 22:34.785
but I chose only you.

281
22:35.585 --> 22:36.585
Do you know why?

282
22:36.665 --> 22:38.385
No idea.

283
22:38.465 --> 22:39.505
All of you

284
22:40.225 --> 22:43.105
fled here from the northwestern frontier.

285
22:44.185 --> 22:45.785
You're fighters by nature.

286
22:46.385 --> 22:47.305
Some of you

287
22:48.345 --> 22:49.665
were attacked by raiders,

288
22:50.305 --> 22:52.505
fought them to the death,

289
22:52.585 --> 22:54.065
and fled after your homes were burned down.

290
22:54.745 --> 22:55.785
Others

291
22:57.185 --> 22:59.825
had their land stolen by powerful landlords,

292
23:01.425 --> 23:04.905
killed their enemies, and had to flee.

293
23:06.305 --> 23:07.145
Aman.

294
23:13.225 --> 23:14.625
That's a lot of money!

295
23:15.945 --> 23:17.505
His Majesty has issued a secret decree.

296
23:18.185 --> 23:19.585
He needs you to carry it out.

297
23:20.545 --> 23:23.745
Succeed, and you'll all be richly rewarded.

298
23:25.065 --> 23:26.345
All that money?

299
23:26.945 --> 23:28.145
-Really? That good? -But if you fail,

300
23:28.785 --> 23:30.905
you'll lose your heads.

301
23:35.425 --> 23:36.385
Get lost!

302
23:37.705 --> 23:40.385
Your Ladyship, I crawled out of a pile of corpses.

303
23:41.025 --> 23:42.425
I was once so hungry I couldn't walk.

304
23:42.505 --> 23:44.025
I could even cut flesh from my own thigh for food.

305
23:44.105 --> 23:45.185
Not one of those rich officials in the capital

306
23:45.265 --> 23:46.945
ever gave me so much as a sip of water.

307
23:47.745 --> 23:49.705
You were the one who saved my life.

308
23:50.785 --> 23:53.025
We don't answer to any emperor. We answer only to you.

309
23:53.625 --> 23:55.025
Whatever you say, we'll do it.

310
23:55.105 --> 23:56.225
-That's right! -Yes, Your Ladyship!

311
23:56.305 --> 23:57.185
-We follow you! -Your orders are ours!

312
23:57.265 --> 23:58.945
-We're with you, Your Ladyship! -Your Ladyship!

313
23:59.025 --> 24:00.065
We follow you!

314
24:00.705 --> 24:01.545
What's your name?

315
24:02.145 --> 24:04.265
I don't have one. They call me Xiao.

316
24:05.225 --> 24:07.665
Your Ladyship, let me bring a few more men.

317
24:07.745 --> 24:09.665
They are the same as me. We lost everything,

318
24:10.385 --> 24:11.665
killed the governor's entire family, and fled.

319
24:12.985 --> 24:14.305
Each of them can take on ten men.

320
24:14.385 --> 24:16.585
-They're all fierce fighters. -Good!

321
24:17.225 --> 24:19.625
Xiao, I'll remember you.

322
24:22.025 --> 24:23.705
Listen up, everyone!

323
24:24.425 --> 24:27.145
Under my command, you'll be rewarded for your achievements.

324
24:27.945 --> 24:31.105
The more you accomplish, the greater your reward!

325
24:32.105 --> 24:33.865
And if any of you are captured alive…

326
24:33.945 --> 24:35.585
They'll only take us dead.

327
24:38.025 --> 24:39.665
If anyone dares betray our benefactor,

328
24:40.185 --> 24:42.225
I'll carve them up alive, piece by piece!

329
24:45.825 --> 24:48.145
We obey your orders, Your Ladyship!

330
25:05.305 --> 25:06.945
Will you report this to Lady Li?

331
25:07.665 --> 25:08.865
Because if you do,

332
25:11.105 --> 25:12.225
you'll be betraying me.

333
25:16.385 --> 25:18.545
When I left the palace, Lady Li told me

334
25:19.345 --> 25:20.905
that my life is tied to yours.

335
25:20.985 --> 25:23.865
I answer only to you now, not to anyone in the palace.

336
25:43.745 --> 25:46.465
ZHUYU ESTATE

337
26:00.225 --> 26:02.305
Your Ladyship, it's past the Xu hour.

338
26:06.745 --> 26:07.705
There's no rush.

339
26:14.265 --> 26:16.825
It's almost the Hai hour. When are we making our move?

340
26:18.385 --> 26:19.265
Wei Rao isn't here yet.

341
26:19.865 --> 26:21.585
She's a pampered noblewoman.

342
26:21.665 --> 26:23.425
Why wait for her when there's fighting to be done?

343
26:24.345 --> 26:25.425
Why don't we make it a contest?

344
26:25.505 --> 26:26.985
First one to find Jin Chang wins.

345
26:28.105 --> 26:30.145
-I'm worried… -You're getting soft.

346
26:30.225 --> 26:32.545
It's just a small operation, and you're already having second thoughts?

347
26:35.105 --> 26:37.745
-I'm worried she won't show up at all. -Why are you being so secretive?

348
26:37.825 --> 26:39.345
Can't you just spit it out?

349
26:39.865 --> 26:42.345
Enough with the riddles. You're getting on my nerves.

350
26:50.305 --> 26:51.185
Her Ladyship left the estate with some men.

351
26:51.265 --> 26:53.265
She shook off everyone tailing her. We don't know where she went.

352
26:54.505 --> 26:55.345
I knew it.

353
26:57.065 --> 26:59.105
Qi Zhongkai. Move in. Now.

354
27:02.065 --> 27:03.105
Move!

355
27:19.985 --> 27:22.145
-Your Highness! -Your Highness!

356
27:22.225 --> 27:24.105
-Over here! -Your Highness, come here!

357
27:24.185 --> 27:25.145
Your Highness!

358
27:32.945 --> 27:33.905
-Hurry! -Hurry!

359
27:41.665 --> 27:43.825
Talk. Where are the prisoners?

360
27:49.025 --> 27:50.825
My Lord, looks like everything's going smoothly.

361
27:52.145 --> 27:53.065
Let's go.

362
27:57.265 --> 27:58.625
Your Highness!

363
28:00.025 --> 28:01.385
What are you doing here?

364
28:01.465 --> 28:04.425
Your Highness, there's trouble. The estate on the east side is on fire.

365
28:04.505 --> 28:06.505
Intruders slipped in during the chaos.

366
28:08.345 --> 28:09.225
Everyone, out.

367
28:11.625 --> 28:13.305
They let all the prisoners escape.

368
28:13.385 --> 28:15.425
Earlier, some foolish clerk at the Court of Justice

369
28:15.505 --> 28:17.145
accepted a petition from those troublemakers,

370
28:17.225 --> 28:19.025
claiming young women vanished without cause

371
28:19.105 --> 28:20.505
The Commandant of Justice had those rebels arrested

372
28:20.585 --> 28:22.025
and locked up at the estate.

373
28:22.105 --> 28:23.145
They hadn't been executed yet.

374
28:23.745 --> 28:25.425
Take half the men from the residence.

375
28:25.505 --> 28:26.905
-Go capture them immediately. -Yes, Your Highness.

376
28:27.505 --> 28:31.465
And remember, keep it quiet. Leave no survivors.

377
28:33.745 --> 28:35.265
Send word to the Northern Army, too.

378
28:36.465 --> 28:38.265
There'll be some unrest in the city tonight.

379
28:39.105 --> 28:40.785
Tell them to stay out of it.

380
28:40.865 --> 28:42.425
-Go. -Yes, Your Highness.

381
28:45.745 --> 28:46.625
Your Highness.

382
28:47.505 --> 28:49.065
Where's that girl I had my eye on?

383
28:50.265 --> 28:51.425
The one selling flatbread.

384
28:51.505 --> 28:53.505
Right, right! I'll see to it at once.

385
28:53.585 --> 28:55.225
-Quick! Go! -I'll send her in.

386
29:01.065 --> 29:03.545
CROWN PRINCE'S RESIDENCE

387
29:12.425 --> 29:14.625
Didn't they just leave? Why are they back?

388
29:25.625 --> 29:28.305
Secure the main gate, rear gate, and both side gates.

389
29:28.945 --> 29:30.505
No one gets in or out.

390
29:39.585 --> 29:41.345
I scouted the place thoroughly during the day.

391
29:41.425 --> 29:43.105
Only one narrow alley from the rear gate leads to the inner courtyard.

392
29:43.745 --> 29:46.025
There's a guard every seven paces. Security is tight.

393
29:46.105 --> 29:48.545
This is a restricted area! Who dares trespass?

394
30:08.745 --> 30:09.625
JINGXING PAVILLION

395
30:26.065 --> 30:27.105
Kill them! Kill them!

396
30:33.785 --> 30:35.465
I… I don't work for the Crown Prince…

397
30:35.545 --> 30:38.025
Please spare me! Have mercy…

398
31:21.265 --> 31:24.105
You think you can fight back? Stop struggling.

399
31:24.185 --> 31:26.785
I'll have some fun with you. You think you can…

400
31:32.505 --> 31:33.545
Who's there?

401
32:26.105 --> 32:26.945
Your Ladyship.

402
32:27.025 --> 32:28.905
What about the women locked up in the back courtyard?

403
32:29.625 --> 32:30.465
Free them all.

404
32:56.705 --> 32:58.785
Don't be afraid. I'm here to rescue you.

405
33:00.665 --> 33:01.865
-Come on! -Let's go!

406
33:01.945 --> 33:02.865
-Hurry! -Move!

407
33:14.265 --> 33:15.345
Come.

408
33:19.505 --> 33:21.025
Someone will meet you at the end of this alley.

409
33:21.625 --> 33:24.305
Whatever happens, don't look back. Just keep running.

410
33:24.385 --> 33:27.065
-Thank you, sir! -Thank you!

411
33:27.145 --> 33:27.985
Go, quickly!

412
33:28.585 --> 33:30.265
Once the job is done, don't hesitate.

413
33:30.785 --> 33:32.425
Avoid Xiyin Street. It's full of government offices.

414
33:33.025 --> 33:36.105
Hide in Jiuquan Alley, Guangbu Ward, or Jingji Ward.

415
33:36.185 --> 33:38.625
Those areas are crowded with refugees and full of winding streets.

416
33:38.705 --> 33:40.265
It'll be nearly impossible to track you down.

417
33:40.865 --> 33:41.745
Go!

418
33:45.065 --> 33:45.945
There are intruders in the Crown Prince's Residence!

419
33:46.025 --> 33:48.425
Alert the Northern Army! Catch those intruders!

420
33:49.345 --> 33:50.385
Let's go.

421
33:51.225 --> 33:52.105
‎Rao.

422
33:52.705 --> 33:54.305
Her Ladyship said to spread out.

423
33:54.385 --> 33:55.825
We can't waste any time.

424
34:22.784 --> 34:23.425
UPHOLD VIRTUE AND HONOR TRADITION

425
34:23.505 --> 34:25.065
Your Highness, forgive my late arrival.

426
34:25.665 --> 34:27.264
I heard His Highness was injured. How is he?

427
34:28.225 --> 34:29.225
His Highness…

428
34:32.744 --> 34:33.905
How is His Highness?

429
34:33.985 --> 34:36.985
Your Highness, His Highness was only shaken up.

430
34:37.065 --> 34:38.824
-He's not seriously hurt. -I'll go see him.

431
34:39.945 --> 34:43.105
Your Highness, His Highness has taken his medicine and gone to bed.

432
34:43.185 --> 34:44.425
He's ordered that no one disturb him.

433
34:45.145 --> 34:47.545
General Li. His Highness orders you to search the entire city.

434
34:47.625 --> 34:49.465
You must capture those intruders before dawn.

435
34:50.185 --> 34:51.025
Understood.

436
34:51.784 --> 34:54.705
It was her. It had to be her!

437
34:55.585 --> 34:57.265
Anyone bold enough to storm the Crown Prince's Residence

438
34:57.345 --> 34:59.465
must be a ruthless criminal.

439
35:00.105 --> 35:01.145
How would Your Highness know such people?

440
35:02.905 --> 35:05.025
The leader has a wound on the chest.

441
35:05.105 --> 35:07.305
Take your men and search every nearby residence.

442
35:07.385 --> 35:10.105
Question anyone suspicious, regardless of rank.

443
35:10.185 --> 35:11.545
Let no one escape.

444
35:12.385 --> 35:14.505
-But… -The Crown Prince is heir to the throne.

445
35:14.585 --> 35:16.745
An attack on his residence threatens the throne itself

446
35:16.825 --> 35:18.105
and defies His Majesty's authority.

447
35:18.705 --> 35:21.705
I've ordered you to find those criminals. Are you defying my orders?

448
35:22.545 --> 35:23.625
Yes, Your Highness.

449
35:24.385 --> 35:25.425
Move out!

450
35:30.065 --> 35:31.625
Hurry! Move.

451
35:36.785 --> 35:39.825
I thought His Highness was only shaken up. What's going on?

452
35:39.905 --> 35:42.745
The imperial physicians are treating him. Please don't worry, Your Highness.

453
35:50.665 --> 35:52.665
What kind of injury is so serious

454
35:53.465 --> 35:55.345
that even I, his own wife,

455
35:56.185 --> 35:57.705
can't be told?

456
35:58.665 --> 36:00.345
Hurry!

457
36:00.425 --> 36:01.465
Hurry! Hurry!

458
36:13.305 --> 36:15.385
Search every street thoroughly!

459
36:15.465 --> 36:17.185
Don't let anyone suspicious get away!

460
36:17.785 --> 36:19.305
You men in the back, keep up!

461
36:40.145 --> 36:41.145
You…

462
36:42.385 --> 36:43.945
What am I supposed to do with you?

463
36:54.705 --> 36:57.585
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

464
36:58.625 --> 37:00.465
General, this is the Duke's residence. Are we searching it too?

465
37:01.945 --> 37:03.705
-Knock on the door. -Move!

466
37:09.145 --> 37:10.345
‎Search under orders!

467
37:12.105 --> 37:12.945
You…

468
37:19.305 --> 37:22.145
SONGYUE HALL

469
37:27.905 --> 37:29.945
SHIZHAI

470
37:32.625 --> 37:34.665
Who dares barge into the Duke's Residence?

471
37:35.265 --> 37:38.065
At midnight tonight, intruders attacked the Crown Prince's Residence.

472
37:38.145 --> 37:39.385
By order of the Crown Prince,

473
37:39.465 --> 37:41.585
I'm searching the entire city for the culprits.

474
37:42.105 --> 37:43.385
Please inform Lord Lu of my arrival.

475
37:45.425 --> 37:46.625
Wait here.

476
37:49.785 --> 37:51.985
My Lord, the Northern Army is here.

477
37:52.065 --> 37:54.065
They say the Crown Prince's Residence was attacked and want to search.

478
38:12.185 --> 38:13.185
How dare you!

479
38:18.545 --> 38:20.385
I'm Li Wei, a captain in the Northern Army.

480
38:21.105 --> 38:22.545
I'm here to search on the Crown Prince's orders.

481
38:23.305 --> 38:26.105
Lord Lu, please come out and speak with me.

482
38:34.385 --> 38:35.225
I heard you.

483
38:36.545 --> 38:39.345
A handful of thieves broke into the Crown Prince's Residence?

484
38:39.865 --> 38:41.985
You men are utterly incompetent.

485
38:42.705 --> 38:45.145
What? And now you want to search my residence?

486
38:46.145 --> 38:49.705
Do you think my men are just as useless as yours?

487
38:52.025 --> 38:52.905
I wouldn't dare.

488
38:53.425 --> 38:54.705
I'm only following orders to search the premises.

489
38:55.305 --> 38:57.785
The thieves may have slipped in disguised. We're just taking precautions.

490
38:59.145 --> 39:01.465
I apologize for the intrusion. Please forgive us, Lord Lu.

491
39:02.265 --> 39:04.265
Please allow us to conduct the search.

492
39:04.345 --> 39:05.625
Absolutely not.

493
39:06.585 --> 39:08.905
-Lord Lu. -There's no one in my room.

494
39:09.585 --> 39:10.505
You may leave.

495
39:11.145 --> 39:14.345
I'm merely following orders. If Lord Lu insists on stopping us,

496
39:14.945 --> 39:17.865
perhaps there's something inside you don't want us to see.

497
39:19.025 --> 39:19.945
What's all that noise?

498
39:21.625 --> 39:22.465
Stop!

499
39:24.345 --> 39:25.625
Think carefully before you act.

500
39:26.465 --> 39:27.905
I'm afraid you don't have the nerve

501
39:29.105 --> 39:30.265
to face who's inside.

502
39:31.505 --> 39:34.425
Zhao Song, Zhao Bai. Keep an eye on him.

503
39:49.185 --> 39:52.305
The leader has a chest wound. One look will confirm it.

504
39:56.745 --> 39:58.825
How dare you! Who said you could come any closer?

505
39:59.905 --> 40:01.505
Get over there and kneel when you speak!

506
40:07.865 --> 40:10.105
Who do you think you are? How dare you lift my bed curtains?

507
40:10.705 --> 40:12.225
Forgive me, Your Ladyship! I didn't recognize you!

508
40:13.505 --> 40:14.545
Please calm down, Your Ladyship.

509
40:15.065 --> 40:17.345
You've got some nerve! What exactly are you looking for?

510
40:17.945 --> 40:20.785
You want to inspect my body? Go ahead, inspect me!

511
40:22.425 --> 40:24.105
You're hardly dressed properly. Go back inside.

512
40:24.185 --> 40:26.665
I won't! Didn't he want to search my bed?

513
40:26.745 --> 40:29.465
Go on! There's a thief hiding in it! Hurry up and search!

514
40:29.545 --> 40:32.625
Open those eyes of yours and take a good, hard look!

515
40:32.705 --> 40:34.425
I didn't know Your Ladyship was here. I was only…

516
40:34.505 --> 40:35.585
You're a captain in the Northern Army!

517
40:35.665 --> 40:38.225
Instead of catching thieves, you sneak into women's private quarters

518
40:38.305 --> 40:39.545
and demand they undress for inspection?

519
40:40.145 --> 40:43.105
Have you no shame? You shameless, filthy creep!

520
40:44.145 --> 40:45.505
Go on. Search!

521
40:46.105 --> 40:47.145
Find a thief, and I'll see you're rewarded.

522
40:47.225 --> 40:49.545
Find nothing, and I'll charge you with abusing your authority!

523
40:49.625 --> 40:51.625
I'll make sure you lose your rank and your job!

524
40:52.305 --> 40:54.105
Had enough? Now get out!

525
40:57.505 --> 41:00.105
He's useless in battle, but he sure knows how to bully women!

526
41:00.185 --> 41:02.825
And he claims he's hunting thieves! Where are they?

527
41:02.905 --> 41:04.025
Who told you to let him leave?

528
41:04.105 --> 41:05.505
-You're no better than him! -Enough.

529
41:05.585 --> 41:07.505
All right, that's enough. It's freezing out here.

530
41:07.585 --> 41:08.505
-You'll catch a cold. -Sheathe your swords!

531
41:09.145 --> 41:10.225
Report!

532
41:12.065 --> 41:14.105
General. We've searched all the other courtyards.

533
41:14.185 --> 41:15.265
There's no sign of the intruders.

534
41:15.345 --> 41:16.705
You worthless scoundrel!

535
41:16.785 --> 41:18.665
Tomorrow, I'll send people to the Marquis of Zhennan's estate

536
41:18.745 --> 41:19.945
to curse you out for a whole month!

537
41:20.025 --> 41:23.545
I'll make sure your entire family, inside and out, is disgraced!

538
41:23.625 --> 41:24.665
Let's go!

539
41:55.305 --> 41:56.665
-How is she? -My Lord,

540
41:57.265 --> 41:59.865
the wound is deep and narrow.

541
42:00.425 --> 42:01.825
It may not heal easily.

542
42:01.905 --> 42:04.985
Once she's recovered a little, the chief physician should examine her.

543
42:05.065 --> 42:07.465
No. We can't call the chief physician.

544
42:07.545 --> 42:09.465
It's just a small wound. I'll be fine.

545
42:10.105 --> 42:11.025
Just change the dressing every day.

546
42:11.705 --> 42:13.665
I'll do everything I can.

547
42:33.025 --> 42:34.345
Have a carriage prepared.

548
42:34.425 --> 42:36.505
At daybreak, send Her Ladyship back to Zhuyu Estate.

549
42:37.345 --> 42:41.105
My Lord, Her Ladyship is injured. She should stay here and recover.

550
42:42.505 --> 42:43.665
You're worrying for nothing.

551
42:44.185 --> 42:46.705
She clearly knows better. She does whatever she wants.

552
42:47.425 --> 42:49.065
She doesn't care what you think.

553
42:49.705 --> 42:53.025
All your concern and worry are completely wasted on her.

554
42:56.265 --> 42:57.105
Heartless woman.

555
43:04.825 --> 43:05.905
Let go.

556
43:15.465 --> 43:16.305
I said, let go.

557
43:18.065 --> 43:18.905
Lu Zhuo.

558
43:24.265 --> 43:25.505
Don't you have anything to say?

559
43:26.745 --> 43:28.025
About the estate…

560
43:30.265 --> 43:31.865
Tell me! Where did you get the nerve

561
43:31.945 --> 43:33.465
to storm the Crown Prince's Residence and rescue those people?

562
43:34.265 --> 43:35.505
And you hid it from me?

563
43:37.545 --> 43:38.985
Easy. That hurts.

564
43:40.145 --> 43:42.465
Well, I read in a military strategy book

565
43:42.545 --> 43:45.865
that success depends on secrecy… No, wait.

566
43:47.505 --> 43:48.945
Speed is everything in battle.

567
43:50.665 --> 43:51.625
I didn't want to keep it from you.

568
43:52.305 --> 43:55.265
But you have important responsibilities. I couldn't drag you into this.

569
43:56.065 --> 43:58.665
I had to handle the dirty work myself.

570
44:00.265 --> 44:02.825
Can't you forgive me just this once? Please?

571
44:05.025 --> 44:05.865
Will you change?

572
44:07.145 --> 44:07.985
No.

573
44:09.545 --> 44:11.185
But I can swear to you.

574
44:13.665 --> 44:15.425
This is the last time I'll ever lie to you.

575
44:16.265 --> 44:18.505
-If I ever lie again, I'll… -You'll what?

576
44:21.185 --> 44:22.665
Be reborn as a pig or a dog.

577
44:23.665 --> 44:24.625
I swear.

578
44:32.065 --> 44:33.225
Your wound hurts again?

579
44:37.105 --> 44:38.105
Are you still mad at me?

580
44:40.105 --> 44:41.665
The Crown Prince's Residence is heavily guarded.

581
44:43.105 --> 44:44.505
If anything had gone wrong,

582
44:46.305 --> 44:47.425
can you really made it out alive?

583
44:51.585 --> 44:53.785
-Actually, I… -You went in

584
44:55.345 --> 44:57.265
knowing you might never come back.

585
44:59.705 --> 45:00.545
Didn't you?

586
45:19.785 --> 45:21.385
You're nothing but a liar.

587
45:24.905 --> 45:26.225
I can't trust you anymore.

588
45:39.025 --> 45:40.025
Lu Zhuo.

589
45:44.305 --> 45:46.625
Your Ladyship, Lord Lu sent me to look after you.

590
45:46.705 --> 45:49.185
Whatever you need, just let me know.

591
48:11.105 --> 48:13.785
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
